## Directory Structure

### Before
```
project_root/
├── debug_*.py (25 files)
├── test_*.py (1 file - test_multidim_suite.py)
├── test_*.zap (6 files)
├── example_*.py (1 file)
└── generated_tests/
    ├── test_*.py (existing generated tests)
    ├── check_*.py (existing check scripts)
    └── ... (other generated content)
```

### After
```
project_root/
├── generated_tests/
│   ├── debug_*.py (25 files - MOVED)
│   ├── test_*.py (37 files total - 1 MOVED + 36 existing)
│   ├── test_*.zap (12 files - 6 MOVED + existing)
│   ├── check_*.py (3 files - existing)
│   ├── example_*.py (1 file - MOVED)
│   └── ... (other generated content)
└── (root now only has core project files)
```

